01:04:01.692 --> 01:04:04.444
{\an8}What should I do with you?
Should I take her as my daughter-in-law?

1083
01:04:04.528 --> 01:04:07.573
{\an8}Actually, I was there earlier
I went because I wanted to see my brother.

1084
01:04:07.656 --> 01:04:10.742
{\an8}The miracle of Christmas
Won't it happen?

1085
01:04:11.368 --> 01:04:13.370
{\an8}Groom and bride enter!

1086
01:04:13.453 --> 01:04:14.830
{\an8}What do you think we are?

1087
01:04:15.831 --> 01:04:18.375
{\an8}What do you think of me and you?

